Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GoBack", "ObjectName",
 CellID->55420344,ExpressionUUID->"b9eaf055-ca3b-48e4-94b0-205e4e23d7ee"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"e9f0a497-d7b4-432d-958e-f7a41c639723"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["GoBack",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:WolframInstitute/MathNotebook/ref/GoBack"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ba1f93fc-7c60-4de0-96e0-b0e071632b9d"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "moves the selection back to the cell from which the last hyperlink was \
clicked."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->593432906,ExpressionUUID->"9e9e2cec-bbf1-45ab-961d-4a0838d3ea0a"],

Cell["\<\
Acts on the front end selection. There is no result to compute, and the \
function does nothing in a kernel with no front end.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->559335307,ExpressionUUID->"ba9dbaff-ba42-44d5-9e1a-bfc744a0ff72"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cell it returns to is held in ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["$LastHyperlinkCell",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"8887b3ac-23ea-4236-a69d-f17adbebdc71"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"fd8a134c-137e-4cc5-baaf-41b1cf3a5377"],
 ", which is set when a reference or citation link is followed."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->923396790,ExpressionUUID->"281edbeb-8102-49c8-9d84-20511c20b5e9"],

Cell["\<\
Before any link has been followed there is nowhere to go back to, and the \
function says so rather than doing nothing.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->14903547,ExpressionUUID->"a653af4e-bed1-4153-b764-7a1cad693101"],

Cell["\<\
A cell that has since been deleted, or whose notebook has been closed, is \
reported the same way: moving the selection to one would otherwise change \
nothing and raise nothing.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->287983755,ExpressionUUID->"3f7330e8-77f8-4c3d-8607-a2f57e06fc0a"]
}, Open  ]],

